    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25066" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">īsŏdŏmos</span></b> ,
		on, adj., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσοδομος,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>equally</i> or <i>evenly built</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">genus isodomon,</span>”
				<i>a mode of building in which the courses of bricks or
						stones are uniform in thickness</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					36, 22, 51, § 171</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Vitr. 2, 8</span></i>.</div>
